.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-agent 1  "quarters-agent " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-agent \- Manage a verified private OpenSSH agent for one space
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-agent\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage a verified private OpenSSH agent for one space
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quarters\-agent\-status(1)
Inspect process, socket identity and protocol liveness
.TP
quarters\-agent\-start(1)
Start a private OpenSSH agent, or report the verified active agent
.TP
quarters\-agent\-stop(1)
Stop only an identity\-verified private OpenSSH agent
.TP
quarters\-agent\-restart(1)
Stop and start the private OpenSSH agent
.TP
quarters\-agent\-recover(1)
Reconcile only dead or protocol\-verified private\-agent state
.TP
quarters\-agent\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
